# Anchored with a leading slash, all of them.
#
# An unanchored "ypstns" matches every path component of that name, which is
# the binary at the top - and also etc/rc.d/ypstns and the whole of
# pkg/openbsd/net/ypstns.  Both were silently absent from the first commit,
# and the first thing to notice was the packaging check in CI, which is rather
# later than one would like.
*.o
*.core
/ypstns
/stns-key-wrapper
/maps_test
/yp_client
/parse.c
/y.tab.h
/obj
__pycache__/
*.pyc
